<td id="S3.T2.5.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">GPT-4o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite></td>
